ATTRIBUTION AND PROVENANCE

Source text for Tasks A, C, and D is drawn from filings on the U.S. Securities
and Exchange Commission's EDGAR system. U.S. government works are not subject
to copyright protection in the United States; the filings themselves are public
records. What is licensed here is the compilation: the selection of filings, the
extracted spans, the ground-truth labels, and the paraphrased subset.

Task B items are original works authored for this benchmark.

The COSO Internal Control — Integrated Framework (2013) and PCAOB Auditing
Standard 2201 are referenced by principle and standard number for the label
taxonomy. Their text is not reproduced in this dataset and is not covered by
this license.

When citing, use the CITATION.cff in this repository and include the benchmark
version. Released versions are immutable; a version number identifies exactly
which items were used.
